  'Family members required to hold a permit under reciprocity apply THROUGH the mission and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs', 'The application is routed by the affiliated representation to the Presidency of Migration Management via the MFA, and approved applicants are then directed to the governorates. Three bodies in one path.',
